Package: strmatch
Title: Tools for String Matching and Text Standardization
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Alvis", "Lee", , "alee134@u.rochester.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package provides tools for identifying, matching and standardizing 
  string data in R. The package includes three functions - (1) str_match, (2) str_find 
  and (3) str_clean.
  
  (1) str_match summarizes categorical string values (i.e counts, proportions). 
  (2) str_find locates target words or patterns within data.
  (3) str_clean matches noisy string data to a user-supplied dictionary for standardization.
  
  These functions are designed to support exploratory data analysis and 
  preprocessing workflows with text-based data.This package will also include a 
  sample dataset and dictionary to showcase str_clean.
